{"availability":"available","full":"lichen-community-systems/Flocking","name":"Flocking","description":"Flocking - Creative audio synthesis for the Web","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":712,"forks":59,"created":"2011-03-27T19:59:47Z","updated":"2026-09-15T19:33:48Z","license":"GPL-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://flockingjs.org/demos/playground","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T01:49:03.433Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T01:49:03.433Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T01:49:03.433Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:16.526Z","stars":712,"forks":59},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:12:31.312Z","stars":712,"forks":59},{"at":"2026-10-06T17:12:25.652Z","stars":712,"forks":59},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:27:08.992Z","stars":712,"forks":59},{"at":"2026-10-11T09:01:18.776Z","stars":712,"forks":59},{"at":"2026-10-17T11:00:57.879Z","stars":712,"forks":59},{"at":"2026-10-20T01:49:03.433Z","stars":712,"forks":59}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Flocking - Creative audio synthesis for the Web!","Flocking is a JavaScript audio synthesis framework designed for artists and musicians who are building creative and experimental Web-based sound projects. It supports Firefox, Chrome, Safari on Mac OS X, Windows, Linux, iOS, and Android.","Unlike comparable tools, Flocking is declarative. Its goal is to promote a uniquely community-minded approach to instrument design and composition. In Flocking, unit generators and synths are specified as JSON, making it easy to save, share, and manipulate your synthesis algorithms. Send your synths via Ajax, save them for later using HTML5 local data storage, or algorithmically produce new instruments on the fly."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lichen-community-systems/Flocking/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"dc2fedf683dca0496425c4f585e6dcd88f22e4273094e0bc4430a7d1644458c5","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:27:01.965Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":